# agent-payload.skills — skills shipped into every active generated project.
#
# Replit discovers `.agents/skills`; Claude Code discovers `.claude/skills`.
# Materialization copies every name below to both registries.  Common skills are
# generated by sync; project skills are maintained here.  `project-init` is the
# only template-control-plane skill and must never be copied into a project.
#
# One skill directory/name per line. Skills must be portable: use installed
# `.claude/rules` and `.claude/agent_docs`, never `templates/generated-project`.

# Common generated skills
verification-gate
production-code-review
fullstack-performance-audit
task-workflow

# Project workflows available to both agents
backend-java-feature
frontend-react-feature
openapi-contract-first
mvp-safety-review
engineering-handoff
finalize-coverage
backend-rule-review
frontend-style-review
aiae-rule-compliance-audit
ui-designer
local-preview
